Description: Plasma weather widget with the edition's stereo weather icons
 Petar Nedyalkov's Advanced Weather Widget with the Sparky Stereo weather
 themes for KDE condition icons, including the current conditions and
 forecast. It uses Plasma's shared engine for the stereo stills and loops.
